# S19: e1m7 frozen at cl.time 1.6, the oracle's clock ("How do you prove a port is
# faithful?"). Classic at 320x200. The camera eases in and stops at file second 4.5 on the
# oracle's own e1m7 view (vieworg -447.96875,64.03125,66.03125, angles 0,0,0).

map e1m7
warmup until 1.6

duration 5.7
fps 60
size 1920x1080

preset classic
mode 320x200
speed 0
hud off
cvar gamma 0.7

camera path
key 1    -520,64.03125,66.03125      0,0  ease inout
key 4.5  -447.96875,64.03125,66.03125  0,0

events on
